        "body": "Dear Blake, <div>\n<div>\n<br>I hope all is well with you. </div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>This is Hanna from Avicenna. It looks like we weren't able to attend the meeting the other day. No worries, we can reschedule at a time that works best for you.<br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Our calendar is shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> <span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">and our schedule is flexible these days.</span>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Looking forward to speaking with you.</div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Hanna</div>\n</div><br><br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>",
