        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Hi Blake, </div><div><br></div><div>I hope you're doing well. </div><div><br></div><div>It seemed like you couldn't attend last week's meeting. No problem. We're still very interested in speaking with you and learning more about your project. <span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">we can reschedule at a time that works best for you.</span>\n</div><div><span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></div><div>\n<span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Our calendar is shared </span><a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\">here</a><span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"> </span><span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">and our schedule is flexible these days.</span>\n</div><div><span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></div><div><span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Best Regards,</span></div><div><span style=\" background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Hanna</span></div><div><br></div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Thursday, September 12, 2024 at 4:45:22 PM, Hanna Badalpoor wrote:<br><br>Dear Blake, <div>\n<div>\n<br>I hope all is well with you. </div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>This is Hanna from Avicenna. It looks like we weren't able to attend the meeting the other day. No worries, we can reschedule at a time that works best for you.<br>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Our calendar is shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> <span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">and our schedule is flexible these days.</span>\n</div>\n<div><br></div>\n<div>Looking forward to speaking with you.</div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Hanna</div>\n</div>\n<br><br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n<br>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div>",
