        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "Good morning, <div> </div><div>I joined the meeting last week, but nobody else attended. I will attempt to coordinate one more meeting, but if things don’t work out for this one, I won’t be re-booking.</div><div> </div><div>Best,</div><div> </div><div>Blake</div><div> </div><div>\n<br><div>\n<div>**********************************************<br>Blake Boehme, M.Sc.<br>Anxiety and Illness Behaviour Laboratory (AIBL)<br>University of Regina, Room CK-211<br>www.AIBL.ca<br><br>Ph.D. Student, Clinical Psychology<br>Department of Psychology, University of Regina<br>bab917@uregina.ca<br>(306)529-6630<br><br>My work is currently supported by a Canadian Institutes for Health Research Doctoral Award and the Dr. Mark Zamorski Award <br><br>Access articles HERE</div>\n</div>\n<div>\n<br><span class=\"js-signatureMarker\"></span><blockquote type=\"cite\">\n<div>On Sep 22, 2024, at 7:42 AM, Hanna Badalpoor &lt;sales@avicennaresearch.com&gt; wrote:</div>\n<br><div>\n<div>Hi Blake,</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>I hope you're doing well.</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>It seemed like you couldn't attend last week's meeting. No problem. We're still very interested in speaking with you and learning more about your project. <span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">we can reschedule at a time that works best for you.</span>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></div>\n<div>\n<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Our calendar is shared </span><a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"> </span><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">and our schedule is flexible these days.</span>\n</div>\n<div><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"><br></span></div>\n<div><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Best Regards,</span></div>\n<div><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">Hanna</span></div>\n<div> </div>\n<div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Thursday, September 12, 2024 at 4:45:22 PM, Hanna Badalpoor wrote:<br><br>Dear Blake, <div>\n<div>\n<br>I hope all is well with you. </div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>This is Hanna from Avicenna. It looks like we weren't able to attend the meeting the other day. No worries, we can reschedule at a time that works best for you.<br>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Our calendar is shared <a href=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" title=\"https://calendar.app.google/k3qhxemdRRqxz5bT6\" target=\"_blank\">here</a> <span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\">and our schedule is flexible these days.</span>\n</div>\n<div> </div>\n<div>Looking forward to speaking with you.</div>\n<div>Best,</div>\n<div>Hanna</div>\n</div>\n<br><br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com/\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>\n</blockquote></div>\n</div>\n</blockquote>\n</div>\n<br>\n</div>",
