        "in_reply_to": "<6696F248-F5B7-4042-AF5A-1D682AD49D92@gmail.com>",
        "content_type": "text/html",
        "body": "<div>Hi Blake,<br>It has been a long time since we heard back from you. I hope all is well.<br><br>This is Maryam from the Avicenna Research team and I wanted<span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"> sincerely apologize for any inconvenience caused by the last meeting.<br><br>I'd like to invite you to another meeting and ensure it's well-coordinated this time. Please feel free to use </span><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"><a href=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ1EU5HWMqxfggGCyKI6ksXJ3kRHoJVtjhCO-AMWqtt36B8Y4CpxdbtceUg_nYXvQWFX2hXUWUwZ\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\" title=\"https://calendar.google.com/calendar/u/0/appointments/schedules/AcZssZ1EU5HWMqxfggGCyKI6ksXJ3kRHoJVtjhCO-AMWqtt36B8Y4CpxdbtceUg_nYXvQWFX2hXUWUwZ\"><span style=\"color: rgb(17, 85, 204);\">the calendar link</span></a></span><span style=\"background-color: initial; color: var(--text-normal);\"> to book a time that works best for you.</span>\n</div><div><br></div><div>Thank you for your understanding, and I look forward to our discussion.</div><div></div><br><br><div>Best regards,</div><div>Maryam</div><div><blockquote type=\"cite\">On Monday, September 23, 2024 at 8:22:08 PM, Blake Boehme wrote:<br><br>Blake<br>\n</blockquote></div><div><br></div><br><br><div data-signature=\"true\" data-signature-id=\"4\">--<br>Avicenna Research (formerly Ethica Data)<br><div><div>4109 - 295 Adelaide St W, Toronto, ON M5V 0L4, Canada</div></div>\n<div>Email: sales@avicennaresearch.com - Web: <a href=\"https://avicennaresearch.com\" rel=\"nofollow noreferrer noopener\" target=\"_blank\">https://avicennaresearch.com</a><br>--</div>\n</div>",
